<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/73/concepts/141974> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/73/concepts/75414> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/73> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tamarac"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "North American wood, the name being applied either to the American Larch; or to the Black or Ridgepole Pine of inland areas; and the Scrub Pine of maritime regions."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/73/concepts/142972> a skos:Concept ;
